{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"program-flow","type":"text","text":"# 📊 Program Flow Analysis\n\n## Execution Stages:\n1. **Initialization** - Setup runtime\n2. **Data Definition** - Create variables\n3. **Validation** - Check inputs\n4. **Processing** - Format data\n5. **Output** - Display result\n6. **Testing** - Verify correctness\n\n## Performance:\n- Time Complexity: O(1)\n- Space Complexity: O(1)\n- Typical Runtime: < 1ms\n\n## Design Pattern:\n**Pipeline Architecture**\n```\nInput → Validate → Process → Output → Test\n```","x":300,"y":-300,"width":400,"height":500,"color":"0"},
		{"id":"code-example","type":"text","text":"# 💻 Complete Code Example\n\n```python\nimport sys\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\ndef main():\n    # Data: Define greeting\n    greeting = \"Hello, World!\"\n    \n    # Verifier: Input check\n    if not greeting:\n        greeting = \"Hello, World!\"  # Default\n    \n    # Logic: Format greeting\n    timestamp = datetime.now().strftime(\"%H:%M:%S\")\n    formatted = f\"[{timestamp}] {greeting}\"\n    \n    # Output: Print to console\n    print(formatted)\n    \n    # Verifier: Integration test\n    assert greeting == \"Hello, World!\"\n    return 0\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    sys.exit(main())\n```","x":300,"y":250,"width":400,"height":550,"color":"0"},
		{"id":"variants","type":"text","text":"# 🌍 Language Variants\n\n## Python\n```python\nprint(\"Hello, World!\")\n```\n\n## JavaScript\n```javascript\nconsole.log(\"Hello, World!\");\n```\n\n## Java\n```java\nSystem.out.println(\"Hello, World!\");\n```\n\n## Rust\n```rust\nfn main() {\n    println!(\"Hello, World!\");\n}\n```\n\n## Go\n```go\nfmt.Println(\"Hello, World!\")\n```","x":750,"y":-300,"width":350,"height":500,"color":"0"},
		{"id":"start-node","type":"text","text":"## 🚀 Start\n**Program Entry Point**\n- Initialize runtime\n- Load dependencies\n- Set execution context","x":-400,"y":-400,"width":280,"height":140,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"define-greeting","type":"text","text":"## 📝 Data: Define Greeting Message\n**Variable Declaration**\n```python\ngreeting = \"Hello, World!\"\n```\n- Type: String\n- Encoding: UTF-8\n- Length: 13 characters\n- Immutable value","x":-400,"y":-50,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"integration-test","type":"text","text":"## 🧪 Verifier: Integration Test\n**Test Cases**\n1. ✓ Output matches expected\n2. ✓ No exceptions thrown\n3. ✓ Execution time < 1ms\n4. ✓ Memory usage acceptable\n\n```python\nassert output == \"Hello, World!\"\nassert exit_code == 0\n```","x":-50,"y":1000,"width":280,"height":260,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"test-failed","type":"text","text":"## ❌ Test Failed\n**Error State**\n- Assertion error\n- Exit code: 1\n- Stack trace logged\n- Debug mode triggered","x":-440,"y":1050,"width":250,"height":160,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"test-passed","type":"text","text":"## ✅ Test Passed\n**Success State**\n- All assertions passed\n- Exit code: 0\n- Clean termination\n- Logs written","x":400,"y":1050,"width":250,"height":160,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"print-console","type":"text","text":"## 🖥️ Output: Print to Console\n**Display Result**\n```python\nprint(formatted)\n# Output: Hello, World!\n```\n- Stream: stdout\n- Buffer: Line-buffered\n- Newline: \\n\n**Console State:**\n- Cursor position updated\n- Buffer flushed","x":-50,"y":540,"width":280,"height":260,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"use-default","type":"text","text":"## ⚠️ Use Default Value\n**Fallback Path**\n```python\ngreeting = \"Hello, World!\"\n```\nOriginal input was:\n- Empty string\n- None/null\n- Invalid type","x":-920,"y":180,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"input-check","type":"text","text":"## ✅ Verifier: Input Check\n**Validation Logic**\n- Check if string is empty\n- Verify default value\n- Type assertion\n- Null safety check\n\n```python\nif not greeting or greeting == \"\":\n    use_default = True\n```","x":-400,"y":525,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"format-greeting","type":"text","text":"## 🎨 Logic: Format Greeting\n**String Processing**\n- Add timestamp (optional)\n- Apply capitalization\n- Add decorators/emojis\n- Escape special characters\n\n```python\nformatted = f\"[{time}] {greeting}\"\n```","x":-50,"y":130,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"4"}
